{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：把推断难题摆上桌面","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-vi","title":"为何变分推断：当后验算不出来的时候","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/foundations/why-vi","wordCount":1586,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"vi-vs-mcmc","title":"变分推断与 MCMC：优化派与采样派的分野","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/foundations/vi-vs-mcmc","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"vi-model","title":"变分框架：隐变量、变分族与优化配方","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/foundations/vi-model","wordCount":1544,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础-把推断难题摆上桌面\">基础：把推断难题摆上桌面</h1><p>这一章不写任何具体算法，它的任务是把「变分推断到底在解什么问题、凭什么这么解」讲到读者心里踏实为止。三篇文档回答三个递进的问题。</p>\n<p>第一篇《为何变分推断》直面根源：后验分布的分母——证据积分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)=\\int p(x,z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>——为什么在绝大多数模型里算不出来，以及面对这个障碍，人类发明了哪几类应对办法。它给出近似推断的整体版图，并说明 VI 在其中的位置：不去逼近积分本身，而是把「求后验」重新表述成「在一个可计算的分布族里做优化」。</p>\n<p>第二篇《变分推断与 MCMC》把 VI 放到它最重要的对照物旁边。同样是应对不可解后验，采样与优化走的是两条哲学不同的路——一条渐近精确但慢，一条快但有系统偏差。这一篇把两者的偏差、方差、可扩展性、收敛判定逐项摆开，给出「什么场景该选谁」的决策依据。真正的采样机理（MCMC/HMC）由《贝叶斯数据分析》hub 主讲，本篇只做定位比较。</p>\n<p>第三篇《变分框架》把前两篇的直觉固化成可操作的数学骨架：隐变量模型的记号、变分族 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的定义与选择、优化目标的雏形，以及一套「建模 → 选族 → 定目标 → 优化」的通用配方。它是通往下一章 ELBO 推导的跳板——读完这里，你就知道那个要被最大化的目标函数将从何而来。</p>\n<p>读完本章，你应当能用一句话回答：变分推断把什么，变成了什么，代价是什么。之后再进入 ELBO 章去看这个目标函数的精确形态。</p>\n"}